/// WASM/DOM backend for the `text` device — merged under `ARCHE_SELECT=text=wasm` (or `[select] text =
/// "wasm"`). Like gfx/wasm there is NO C shim and no `#link`: the wasm link drops device C shims, so these
/// `text_be_*` stay undefined and become wasm IMPORTS the JS host (www/text.js) fulfils by creating
/// positioned `<span>`s. Byte-identical `#foreign` contract shape to gfx/wasm/backend.arche. The seams are
/// `#module`-private, so importers see only the public `text.*` wrappers. Not a standalone test.
// RUN: true
#module
#foreign
text_be_draw  :: proc(x: int, y: int, own s: []char, n: int, size: int, color: int);
text_be_clear :: proc();
